    "body": "<header>\n<h1 data-aid=\"128478167\" id=\"title1\"><strong>Jesus Christ, Rock</strong></h1>\n</header>\n<div class=\"body-block\">\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478169\" id=\"p1\">from thence is the shepherd, the <span class=\"key-word\">stone</span> of Israel, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/gen/49?lang=eng&amp;id=p24#p24\">Gen. 49:24</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/50?lang=eng&amp;id=p44#p44\">D&amp;C 50:44</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478171\" id=\"p2\">He is the <span class=\"key-word\">Rock</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/deut/32?lang=eng&amp;id=p4#p4\">Deut. 32:4</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478173\" id=\"p3\">lightly esteemed the <span class=\"key-word\">Rock</span> of his salvation, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/deut/32?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">Deut. 32:15</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478175\" id=\"p4\">neither is there any <span class=\"key-word\">rock</span> like our God, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/1-sam/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2\">1 Sam. 2:2</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478177\" id=\"p5\">Lord is my <span class=\"key-word\">rock</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/2-sam/22?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2\">2 Sam. 22:2</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478179\" id=\"p6\"><span class=\"key-word\">Rock</span> of Israel spake to me, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/2-sam/23?lang=eng&amp;id=p3#p3\">2 Sam. 23:3</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478181\" id=\"p7\">Lord is my <span class=\"key-word\">rock</span>, and my fortress, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/ps/18?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2\">Ps. 18:2</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478183\" id=\"p8\">who is a <span class=\"key-word\">rock</span> save our God, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/ps/18?lang=eng&amp;id=p31#p31\">Ps. 18:31</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478184\" id=\"p9\">my <span class=\"key-word\">rock</span> … the God of my salvation, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/ps/18?lang=eng&amp;id=p46#p46\">Ps. 18:46</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/1-ne/15?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">1 Ne. 15:15</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/2-ne/4?lang=eng&amp;id=p30#p30\">2 Ne. 4:30</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/2-ne/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p45#p45\">9:45</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/jacob/7?lang=eng&amp;id=p25#p25\">Jacob 7:25</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478185\" id=\"p10\">lead me to the <span class=\"key-word\">rock</span> that is higher than I, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/ps/61?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2\">Ps. 61:2</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478186\" id=\"p11\">He only is my <span class=\"key-word\">rock</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/ps/62?lang=eng&amp;id=p6#p6\">Ps. 62:6</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478187\" id=\"p12\"><span class=\"key-word\">stone</span> which the builders refused is become the head stone, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/ps/118?lang=eng&amp;id=p22#p22\">Ps. 118:22</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/21?lang=eng&amp;id=p42#p42\">Matt. 21:42</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/luke/20?lang=eng&amp;id=p17#p17\">Luke 20:17</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478188\" id=\"p13\">a <span class=\"key-word\">rock</span> of offence to both the houses of Israel, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/8?lang=eng&amp;id=p14#p14\">Isa. 8:14</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478189\" id=\"p14\">not been mindful of the <span class=\"key-word\">rock</span> of thy strength, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/17?lang=eng&amp;id=p10#p10\">Isa. 17:10</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478190\" id=\"p15\"><span class=\"key-word\">rock</span> whence ye are hewn, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/51?lang=eng&amp;id=p1#p1\">Isa. 51:1</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/2-ne/8?lang=eng&amp;id=p1#p1\">2 Ne. 8:1</a>).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478191\" id=\"p16\"><span class=\"key-word\">stone</span> which was set at nought of you builders, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/acts/4?lang=eng&amp;id=p11#p11\">Acts 4:11</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478192\" id=\"p17\">lay in Sion a stumblingstone and <span class=\"key-word\">rock</span> of offence, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/rom/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p33#p33\">Rom. 9:33</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-pet/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p8#p8\">1 Pet. 2:8</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/2-ne/18?lang=eng&amp;id=p14#p14\">2 Ne. 18:14</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478193\" id=\"p18\">drank of … spiritual <span class=\"key-word\">Rock</span> … and that <span class=\"key-word\">Rock</span> was Christ, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-cor/10?lang=eng&amp;id=p4#p4\">1 Cor. 10:4</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478194\" id=\"p19\">Lamb, and my <span class=\"key-word\">rock</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/1-ne/13?lang=eng&amp;id=p36#p36\">1 Ne. 13:36</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478195\" id=\"p20\">Jews … will reject the <span class=\"key-word\">stone</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/jacob/4?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">Jacob 4:15</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478196\" id=\"p21\"><span class=\"key-word\">rock</span> of our Redeemer, who is Christ, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/hel/5?lang=eng&amp;id=p12#p12\">Hel. 5:12</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478197\" id=\"p22\">I am Messiah, the … <span class=\"key-word\">Rock</span> of Heaven, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/pgp/moses/7?lang=eng&amp;id=p53#p53\">Moses 7:53</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul class=\"reference\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"title\" data-aid=\"128478198\" id=\"title2\"><em>See also</em> <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/16?lang=eng&amp;id=p18#p18\">Matt. 16:18</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</div>",
